      "clean_comment": "From arrival we knew this was going to be a good stay. Daura on front of house was so helpful and vibrant- she was really informative and welcoming, suggesting places to eat.\nStay was great, beautiful building, room and facilities. Stayed in Manchester many times before and this is the best place I’ve stayed at such an amazing price!\nRooms are a little hot but fans provided.\nStayed with our baby and cot was kindly provided ahead of time and accessible room.\nWould 100% recommend.\nAlso seems a great place to do EVERYTHING- eat, drink, work, relax. Will be back!",
